h-related drugs. From a geographical perspective, 53% of the company&#x27;s 2025 sales were generated from US human health (pharmaceuticals and vaccines).</p><button class=\"linkish\" type=\"button\" data-more>More</button></div><dl class=fields><dt>Industry</dt><dd><a class=\"go\" data-go=\"industry:pharmaceuticals\">Pharmaceuticals</a></dd><dt>Country</dt><dd><a class=\"go\" data-go=\"country:US\">United States</a></dd></dl><h3 class=\"sub\">Betas</h3><table class=\"cmp \"><thead><tr><th></th><th class=\"n\">Beta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th><a class=\"go name\" data-go=\"factor:1\">S&amp;P 500</a></th><td class=n><span class=\"n v\">0.27</span></td></tr><tr><th><a class=\"go name\" data-go=\"factor:2\">Long Treasury yield</a></th><td class=n><span class=\"n v\">0.44</span></td></tr><tr><th><a class=\"go name\" data-go=\"factor:3\">US dollar against major currencies</a></th><td class=n><span class=\"n v\">−0.17</span></td></tr><tr><th><a class=\"go name\" data-go=\"factor:4\">Crude oil price</a></th><td class=n><span class=\"n v\">−0.02</span></td></tr><tr><th><a class=\"go name\" data-go=\"factor:5\">Semiconductor stocks</a></th><td class=n><span class=\"n v\">−0.24</span></td></tr><tr><th><a class=\"go name\" data-go=\"factor:6\">Bitcoin</a></th><td class=n><span class=\"n v\">−0.01</span></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 class=\"sub\">Events</h3><table class=\"ifs\"><thead><tr><th>Event</th><th>If Yes</th><th>If No</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr data-k=\"ev:prop:12\"><td><a class=\"go\" data-go=\"prop:12\">The Fed&#x27;s rate is 4.75% or higher after its April 28, 2027 meeting</a><div class=\"aside\">Forecast 44.2%</div></td><td><a class=\"go num\" data-go=\"x:swing:prop:12\"><span class=\"n v loss\">−$9</span></a></td><td><a class=\"go num\" data-go=\"x:swing:prop:12\"><span class=\"n v gain\">+$7</span></a></td></tr><tr data-k=\"ev:prop:5\"><td><a class=\"go\" data-go=\"prop:5\">The US launches another round of extensive strikes on Iran by May 18, 2027</a><div cl